 <kbd>Enter</kbd> key is not functional if the last character of the search string is a `/`.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### Reproduction steps\r\nIt may be of relevance that I am using the Nix build, and in order to get the latest master to work I had to update the `rev` and the corresponding `sha256` to the latest commit mentioned above in the \"flake.nix\" file. Other than this, no changes were made to the codebase.\r\n\r\nThere isn't much else to do to reproduce. Start a search with <kbd>/</kbd> or even a split with <kbd>s</kbd> and then type any string, so long as the last character is `/` and then hit <kbd>Enter</kbd> and observe how nothing happens and the search prompt remains open.\r\n\r\n<!-- Ideally provide a key sequence and/or asciinema.org recording. --> \r\n\r\n### Environment\r\n\r\n- Platform: NixOS\r\n- Helix version: v0.3.0-108-gd4bd5b3\r\n\r\nlog doesn't seem to contain any useful information","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helix-editor/helix/issues/488/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helix-editor/helix/issues/488/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helix-editor/helix/issues/comments/885348896","html_url":"https://github.com/helix-editor/helix/issues/487#issuecomment-885348896","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helix-editor/helix/issues/487","id":885348896,"node_id":"IC_kwDOD__WI840xVog","user":{"login":"archseer","id":1372918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNzI5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1372918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/archseer","html_url":"https://github.com/archseer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archseer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archseer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archseer